@startuml
title FSM QueryParserActor — пошаговый разбор DSL

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> READY

READY --> CLASSIFYING_QUERY : ParseTokenStreamRequest

state CLASSIFYING_QUERY
CLASSIFYING_QUERY --> PARSING_CONTEXT_SPAN : keyword CONTEXT
CLASSIFYING_QUERY --> PARSING_FIND_TARGET : keyword FIND

state PARSING_CONTEXT_SPAN
PARSING_CONTEXT_SPAN --> PARSING_CONTEXT_SPAN : ContinueParseContextSpan
PARSING_CONTEXT_SPAN --> PARSING_CONTEXT_PATTERNS : span готов

state PARSING_CONTEXT_PATTERNS
PARSING_CONTEXT_PATTERNS --> PARSING_CONTEXT_PATTERNS : ContinueParseContextPatterns
PARSING_CONTEXT_PATTERNS --> PARSING_CONTEXT_CONSTRAINTS : шаблоны готовы

state PARSING_CONTEXT_CONSTRAINTS
PARSING_CONTEXT_CONSTRAINTS --> PARSING_CONTEXT_CONSTRAINTS : ContinueParseContextConstraints
PARSING_CONTEXT_CONSTRAINTS --> PARSING_FIND_TARGET : ключевое слово FIND

state PARSING_FIND_TARGET
PARSING_FIND_TARGET --> PARSING_FIND_CONSTRAINTS : target распознан

state PARSING_FIND_CONSTRAINTS
PARSING_FIND_CONSTRAINTS --> PARSING_FIND_CONSTRAINTS : ContinueParseFindConstraints
PARSING_FIND_CONSTRAINTS --> READY : конец потока / DslQueryParsed

note right of READY
  Self-transitions по Continue*-сообщениям
  отражают cooperative parsing: каждый шаг
  обрабатывает порцию токенов и возвращает
  управление scheduler'у.
end note

note bottom
  Источник: src/dsl/parsing/states.py (DslQueryParserState),
  src/dsl/actors/parsing/query_parser_actor.py.
end note

@enduml
